# English strings for the housekeeping half of the app: the engine supervisor
# (Aria2Manager), the log file settings and the history page's batch selection.
#
# Format is "中文 => English"; a [Context] prefix restricts an entry to one Qt
# context (see tools/make-translations.ps1).

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 引擎 / engine
aria2 引擎意外退出（退出码 %1）。 => The aria2 engine exited unexpectedly (code %1).
aria2 引擎已退出，正在自动重启… => The aria2 engine stopped; restarting it…
aria2 引擎已重新启动，下载可以继续了。 => The aria2 engine is running again; downloads can continue.
aria2 引擎连续 %1 次启动失败，已停止自动重启。请在「设置 → RPC / 引擎」里检查引擎路径与参数。 => The aria2 engine failed to start %1 times in a row, so automatic restarting has stopped. Check the engine path and arguments under Settings → RPC / Engine.
引擎已重启，已恢复 %1 个未完成的下载。 => The engine is running again and %1 unfinished download(s) were handed back to it.
引擎尚未就绪，已排队 %1 个任务，连接后自动开始。 => The engine is not ready yet; %1 task(s) are queued and will start as soon as it is.

# ------------------------------------------------------------- 日志 / logging
日志 => Logs
程序运行日志写入下方的目录；引擎输出、崩溃报告都在里面。 => Fetchora writes its log files to the folder below: engine output, warnings and crash reports all end up there.
日志保留天数 => Days of logs to keep
超过这个天数的日志会被自动删除；单个文件超过 4 MB 也会自动切分 => Older files are deleted automatically; a file that grows past 4 MB is split, so a week of logs stays a few megabytes
打开日志目录 => Open the log folder
无法打开日志目录 %1 => Could not open the log folder %1
天 => days

# ------------------------------------------------------- 导航与搜索 / navigation + search
下载任务 => Downloads
搜索下载任务 => Search downloads
在下载任务里按文件名或链接搜索；历史与设置页各有自己的搜索框 => Search the download list by file name or link. The history and settings pages have their own search boxes.

# --------------------------------------------------- 断点续传 / resume behaviour
下载前删除续传文件 => Delete the resume data before downloading
每次开始下载都丢掉 .aria2 续传记录：暂停、继续与断点续传都会失效 => Throw away the .aria2 resume record at the start of every download: pausing, resuming and continuing an interrupted transfer all stop working

# --------------------------------------------------------- 批量选择 / batch selection
批量选择 => Select
退出批量选择 => Done selecting
退出批量选择模式 => Leave batch selection mode
勾选多条记录后一起删除 => Tick several entries and delete them together
已选择 %1 条 => %1 selected
全选 => Select all
取消全选 => Clear selection
全选或取消全选当前列表 => Select or clear every entry in the list
删除选中 => Delete selected
删除选中 (%1) => Delete selected (%1)
取消 => Cancel
删除选中的历史记录 => Delete the selected history entries
将从历史记录中删除选中的 %1 条记录。已经下载的文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。 => This removes %1 selected entries from the history. Files that were already downloaded are not touched, and it cannot be undone.
已删除 %1 条历史记录 => Deleted %1 history entries
没有可删除的记录 => There was nothing to delete

# ------------------------------------------------------- Tracker 列表 / trackers
导入列表 => Import list
从一个文件或一个网址导入 Tracker 列表：每行一个地址，非 Tracker 的行会被忽略 => Import a tracker list from a file or a URL: one address per line; anything that is not a tracker is ignored
导入 Tracker 列表 => Import tracker list
从哪里读取 Tracker 列表？\n每行一个地址；不是 Tracker 的内容会被忽略。 => Where should the tracker list come from?\nOne address per line; anything that is not a tracker is ignored.
本地文件… => Local file…
网址… => URL…
取消 => Cancel
选择 Tracker 列表文件 => Choose a tracker list file
文本文件 (*.txt *.list *.md);;所有文件 (*) => Text files (*.txt *.list *.md);;All files (*)
从网址导入 Tracker => Import trackers from a URL
列表地址（http 或 https） => List address (http or https)
只支持 http 或 https 地址 => Only http or https addresses are supported
下载列表失败：%1 => Could not download the list: %1
这个文件看起来不是文本（可能是种子、压缩包或程序），已忽略 => That file does not look like text (it may be a torrent, an archive or a program); ignored
这个地址返回的不是文本列表，已忽略 => That address did not return a text list; ignored
文件太大，已忽略 => The file is too large; ignored
列表太大，已忽略 => The list is too large; ignored
列表太大或条目过多，已忽略 => The list is too large or has too many entries; ignored
已从 %1 导入 %2 个 Tracker（超出上限，只取了前 %2 个），跳过 %3 行 => Imported the first %2 tracker(s) from %1 (the list is longer than the cap), skipped %3 line(s)
%1 里没有找到 Tracker 地址（已跳过 %2 行） => No tracker addresses found in %1 (%2 line(s) skipped)
已从 %1 导入 %2 个 Tracker，跳过 %3 行 => Imported %2 tracker(s) from %1, skipped %3 line(s)
已添加 %1 个 Tracker。 => Added %1 tracker(s).
没有可添加的 Tracker 地址。 => There is no tracker address to add.
已添加 %1 个磁力链接 => Added %1 magnet link(s)
每行一个或用逗号分隔；留空则使用内置的公共 Tracker 列表 => One per line or comma-separated; leave it empty to use the built-in public tracker list

# ------------------------------------------------------- Tracker 页 / tracker page
Tracker => Tracker
全局 Tracker 列表 => Global tracker list
应用于所有 BitTorrent 任务 => Applies to every BitTorrent task
这一份列表会下发给所有 BitTorrent 任务；单个任务的 Tracker 在任务详情里编辑 => This list is handed to every BitTorrent task; a single task's trackers are edited in the task details
恢复内置 => Use the built-in list
清空自定义列表，改用随程序内置的公共 Tracker => Clear the custom list and go back to the public trackers that ship with the app
已恢复内置 Tracker 列表。 => Back to the built-in tracker list.
已更新全局 Tracker 列表（%1 个）。 => Global tracker list updated (%1 entries).
已从 %1 导入 %2 个 Tracker（新增 %3），跳过 %4 行 => Imported %2 tracker(s) from %1 (%3 new), skipped %4 line(s)
只有种子任务有 Tracker => Only torrent tasks have trackers
该任务还没有 Tracker；添加后更容易找到其它节点 => This task has no trackers yet; adding some makes peers easier to find
Tracker 列表 => Tracker list
为种子任务添加、导入与移除 Tracker；磁力链接的 Tracker 在添加时下发 => Add, import and remove the trackers of a torrent task; a magnet link gets its trackers when it is added
网址或路径… => URL or path…
从网址或路径导入 Tracker => Import trackers from a URL or a path
列表地址（http/https）或本地文件路径 => List address (http/https) or a local file path
只支持 http、https 地址或本地文件路径 => Only http/https addresses or a local file path are supported
磁力 => Magnet
粘贴 magnet:?xt=urn:btih:... 链接（可多条） => Paste magnet:?xt=urn:btih:... links (several are fine)
以逗号分隔；留空则使用内置的公共 Tracker 列表，批量导入请用 BitTorrent 页的「导入列表」 => Comma-separated; leave it empty to use the built-in public tracker list. To import a list in bulk, use “Import list” on the BitTorrent page
粘贴 magnet:?xt=urn:btih:... 链接（可多行） => Paste magnet:?xt=urn:btih:... links (several lines are fine)
没有找到 magnet: 开头的链接 => No link starting with magnet: was found

# ------------------------------------------------- 复制链接 / copying a link
已复制下载链接：%1 => Copied the download link: %1
已复制「%1」的链接：%2 => Copied the link of “%1”: %2
这个任务没有可复制的链接 => This task has no link to copy
这个任务已经不在了，无法复制链接 => That task is gone, so there is no link to copy
